  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6294943)  \n[Official Simplified Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/METROPOLIS/wuhendeyitian/list?title_no=1826)  \nNae-Ri Oh, who has lived her life tenaciously despite the betrayal of her ex-boyfriend and best friend.  \n From one day on, every night after 12:00 no one remembers her day.  \n However, at the end of 1000 days, a webcomic artist 'Now' appears, who remembers her yesterday.  \n She decides to take revenge on her trashy ex-boyfriend, Hyun Jae-seung, with her webtoon...",
